  "title": "Answer: experience is local recurrent processing, derived",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "488ba36a-fd1d-4cc1-9c1a-35a4058e1df5",
      "text": "Phenomenal experience is recurrent processing within sensory cortex, with or without access. It is derived from neural processing, not basic: the same signals passing only forward are not experienced.",
